WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.034 --> 00:00:02.290
- My kids won't even know what a TV is.

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:03.509
- And when they do see a TV,

00:00:03.509 --> 00:00:04.910
they'll be like, "What do we need this for

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.353
"when we already have books?"

00:00:06.353 --> 00:00:09.157
(both laugh)

00:00:09.157 --> 00:00:14.058
("On Your Toes")

00:00:14.058 --> 00:00:16.800
- My kid's favorite thing to
eat is gonna be vegetables.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.511
- They're gonna be like,

00:00:17.511 --> 00:00:19.401
"Mom, we're out of asparagus again."

00:00:19.401 --> 00:00:21.839
And I'll be like, "You
kids and your asparagus."

00:00:21.839 --> 00:00:24.379
- I'm not gonna be one of those
schedule obsessed parents.

00:00:24.379 --> 00:00:25.455
I'm gonna be chill.

00:00:25.455 --> 00:00:26.960
And my kids are gonna appreciate it.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.930
- I am never gonna say that I can't go out

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:31.632
after 10 pm because I got kids.

00:00:31.632 --> 00:00:34.009
- Yeah, that's what Red Bull
and baby sitters are for.

00:00:34.009 --> 00:00:34.781
- Yes!

00:00:34.781 --> 00:00:37.544
- I'll always be on time, just like now.

00:00:37.544 --> 00:00:38.702
- And when my kids are tired,

00:00:38.702 --> 00:00:39.759
they'll go to bed.

00:00:39.759 --> 00:00:40.917
It's not rocket science.

00:00:40.917 --> 00:00:42.664
- There's no reason why having a baby

00:00:42.664 --> 00:00:44.431
should prevent you from doing Cross Fit.

00:00:44.431 --> 00:00:46.647
- When my kid says, "Watch, mommy."

00:00:46.647 --> 00:00:48.678
I'm gonna watch every single time.

00:00:48.678 --> 00:00:50.141
- Oh absolutely.

00:00:50.141 --> 00:00:52.091
I hate it when people are
like, "Just a minute, honey."

00:00:52.091 --> 00:00:53.047
That's your kid.

00:00:53.047 --> 00:00:54.184
- I will never leave the house

00:00:54.184 --> 00:00:55.789
looking less than put together.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:58.349
- I'm not even gonna own
a pair of sweat pants.

00:00:58.349 --> 00:01:00.498
(both laugh)

00:01:02.746 --> 00:01:03.824
- Awww.

00:01:03.824 --> 00:01:05.062
- I miss being an expert.

00:01:05.062 --> 00:01:10.062
("On Your Toes")

